# JPA usage

Queries only in `*Repository` classes.

- Static lookups → JPQL (`FROM Channel WHERE youtubeId = :youtubeId`).
- Named parameters always.
- Native SQL last resort with comment explaining why.

No `EntityManager` in endpoints or `Sync*Task` (inject repositories).

See [engage-layered-architecture.mdc](engage-layered-architecture.mdc).
